# Modular (CR 702.43a) targets an artifact creature, not just any creature: when Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills Arcbound Wanderer (two +1/+1 counters), Bot1's
# ability has two legal targets - Suntouched Myr and Bot2's Alpha Myr, both artifact creatures - and Bot2's Balduvian Bears, a creature but no artifact, is
# refused. Bot1 chooses the Suntouched Myr, which gets the Wanderer's two counters (a 3/3); the Alpha Myr stays a 2/1.

